<title>USA: CNA acquires stake in residual value insurer.</title>
<headline>CNA acquires stake in residual value insurer.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNA Financial Corp said Thursday its CNA Casualty Co has entered a letter of intent with Quantum Industrial partners to acquire a 50 percent stake RVI Guaranty Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Quantum Industrial partners is managed by Chatterjee Group.</p>
<p>RVI insures assets financed by banks and other financial companies, guaranteeing the value of the products, such as leased automobiles, CNA said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
